WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.855
This query truncates each order timestamp to month
grain It then groups

00:00:05.881 --> 00:00:12.000
orders by that month bucket COUNT measures order
volume and SUM calculates

00:00:12.013 --> 00:00:17.974
monthly revenue The cast to date is mainly for a
simpler displayed month label

00:00:19.731 --> 00:00:24.810
The important analytical decision is the month-level
grain created by DATE_TRUNC
